    "progressSummary": "COMPLETED: Full biconditional renyi_monotone_iff_powerMean_monotone proved in AmgmInequalityOQ03OQ04.lean. 0 sorries, 0 axioms.",
    "builtItems": [
      "renyiEntropy: H_α(p) = (1/(1-α))·log(Σ pᵢ^α) (AmgmInequalityOQ03OQ04.lean:65-66)",
      "selfPowerMean: M_r(p,p) = (Σ pᵢ·pᵢ^r)^(1/r) (AmgmInequalityOQ03OQ04.lean:70-71)",
      "renyi_sum_eq_powerMean_sum: Σ pᵢ·pᵢ^(α-1) = Σ pᵢ^α (AmgmInequalityOQ03OQ04.lean:87-90)",
      "renyi_eq_neg_log_powerMean: H_α = -log(M_{α-1}) (AmgmInequalityOQ03OQ04.lean:120-134)",
      "renyi_monotone_iff_powerMean_monotone: full biconditional (AmgmInequalityOQ03OQ04.lean:195-206)",
      "renyi_two_eq_neg_log_collision: H_2 = -log(collision probability) (AmgmInequalityOQ03OQ04.lean:214-222)"
    ],
    "insights": [
      "H_α(p) = -log(M_{α-1}(p,p)) — these two monotonicity results from different fields are the same statement",
      "Key algebraic fact: pᵢ·pᵢ^(α-1) = pᵢ^α by Real.rpow_add — this is the entire algebraic content",
      "Proof of biconditional uses: neg_le_neg (for → direction) and exp/log round-trip (for ← direction)",
      "The ← direction: H_{t+1} ≤ H_{r+1} gives -log(M_t) ≤ -log(M_r), flip and exponentiate to get M_r ≤ M_t",
      "Real.log_rpow handles log(x^r) = r·log(x); field_simp + ring handles the arithmetic identity (1/(1-α)) = -(1/(α-1))"
    ],
